Package: mighty.metadata
Title: CDISC ADaM Metadata Management in YAML Format
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ari", "Siggaard Knoph", email = "aikp@novonordisk.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Esben","Tore Moelgaard", email = "ebtm@novonordisk.com", role = c("aut")),
    person("Novo Nordisk A/S", role = c("cph"))
  )
Description: Tools for working with CDISC ADaM metadata in YAML format. This package 
    provides functions for extracting metadata from standard sources, building 
    structured ADaM metadata, generating YAML files, and HTML visualization. 
    It supports domain references tracking and maintains proper formatting for 
    method fields in YAML output.
